# Accepted vulnerability exceptions for the CI release gate (fixable HIGH/CRITICAL).
#
# Every entry needs: the ID, why it does not apply or cannot be fixed yet, who
# accepted it, and an expiry date after which it must be re-reviewed. Entries
# are reviewed in pull requests like any other change. See
# docs/security/supply-chain.md for the triage process.
#
# Format:
#   # <component>: <reason>. Accepted by <name> on <date>.
#   CVE-XXXX-NNNNN exp:YYYY-MM-DD
#
# No exceptions are currently accepted.
